    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/678c631094d2cd8afb0bdce73dae3bfb.avif?t=1753715845\" width=520 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an erotic management simulation game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a beautiful girl (futanari) born into a wealthy family, have opened a coffee shop as a hobby. While managing the coffee shop, you'll hire many beautiful girls as maids and develop naughty relationships with them\u266a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, earn money by managing the coffee shop. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/41c6a080626010b66b9197b78cd06407.poster.avif?t=1753715845\" width=640 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/41c6a080626010b66b9197b78cd06407.webm?t=1753715845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/41c6a080626010b66b9197b78cd06407.mp4?t=1753715845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your funds increase, hire more maids and automate the business. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/f50c15fd8858defb2a812bff48480307.poster.avif?t=1753715845\" width=640 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/f50c15fd8858defb2a812bff48480307.webm?t=1753715845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/f50c15fd8858defb2a812bff48480307.mp4?t=1753715845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, expand the shop to generate even more revenue. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/c1df647a2300ca35e0a3d8ebb9a82cdb.poster.avif?t=1753715845\" width=640 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/c1df647a2300ca35e0a3d8ebb9a82cdb.webm?t=1753715845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/c1df647a2300ca35e0a3d8ebb9a82cdb.mp4?t=1753715845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the maids' affection through gifts! And then the erotic development!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/985938e010af60918f1670f27ad5a224.poster.avif?t=1753715845\" width=640 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/985938e010af60918f1670f27ad5a224.webm?t=1753715845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306200/extras/985938e010af60918f1670f27ad5a224.mp4?t=1753715845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access version now available! Be sure to add it to your wishlist~</p></li></ul>",
